# Honored Dreyleader: "Whenever another Squirrel or Food you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Turn 1: the Dreyleader
# enters with nothing else (a 1/1); Bot1's Memnite (an artifact creature) and a Gold Pan with its Treasure token are neither Squirrels
# nor Foods and give it nothing. Turn 2: Bot2 casts a Heaped Harvest, a Food under the opponent's control, and nothing happens. Turn 3: Bot1's
# own Heaped Harvest (a Food) enters and the Dreyleader gets exactly one counter (a 2/2), even though the Harvest's own trigger is also on the stack.

